<title>USA: MotivePower stake raised by investor.</title>
<headline>MotivePower stake raised by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investor Richard L. Chilton, Jr said Wednesday he raised his stake in MotivePower Industries Inc to 10.4 percent or 1,834,413 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Chilton said he bought 278,711 shares between December 20 and January 6 at prices ranging from $7.185 and $8.060 per share.</p>
<p>The filing said Chilton previously held an 8.9 percent stake in the Pittsburgh-based company, which was formerly known as MK Rail Corp.</p>
